00:24:26.890 --> 00:24:34.470
Toby, really played a great creative part throughout the entirety of the office and especially in this episode in this cold open.
托比，在整部《办公室》里，特别是在这集的片头前情中，真的发挥了巨大的创意作用。

557
00:24:35.270 --> 00:24:35.790
Wow.
哇。

558
00:24:35.870 --> 00:24:36.650
I didn't know that.
我不知道这个。

