I know that, Jenna, because I got a tour of an old Western set with my dad, and they
我知道这个，珍娜，因为我小时候跟我爸参观过一个老西部片片场，他们

644
00:28:26.510 --> 00:28:31.510
were like, all those windows that guys get thrown out the bars in and the saloon, that
当时就说，酒吧里那些把人扔出去的窗户，全部

645
00:28:31.510 --> 00:28:32.350
was candy.
都是糖做的。

646
00:28:32.750 --> 00:28:33.190
Candy.
糖做的。

647
00:28:33.550 --> 00:28:33.690
Yeah.
对。

648
00:28:33.690 --> 00:28:34.510
You could eat it.
你还能吃呢。

649
00:28:34.510 --> 00:28:40.650
I guess nowadays, they don't make it out of candy, but Randy said old schoolers still call it candy glass,
我猜现在它们不是用糖做的了，但兰迪说老一辈人仍然叫它糖玻璃，

