00:28:43.250 --> 00:28:43.410
Okay.
好的。

652
00:28:43.870 --> 00:28:48.690
And Randy also told us, Jaden, in answer to your question, they got it in one take.
兰迪还告诉我们，杰登，针对你的问题，他们一遍就拍过了。

653
00:28:49.110 --> 00:28:52.370
One throw of the projector broke the breakaway glass.
投影仪扔出去一次就砸碎了特制的道具玻璃。

654
00:28:52.590 --> 00:28:53.370
There you go.
就是这样。

655
00:28:53.370 --> 00:28:59.070
So, Jaden would also like to know how many times did Kevin break the vending machine?
所以，杰登还想知道凯文砸了多少次自动售货机？

