Swinging approved while I'm yelling, I only weigh 82 pounds.
在我大喊大叫的情况下晃动通过，我才82磅重。

955
00:42:30.600 --> 00:42:31.040
Right?
对吧？

956
00:42:31.420 --> 00:42:33.040
I'm sure the cat loved that.
我敢肯定猫咪很喜欢那样。

957
00:42:33.280 --> 00:42:34.440
You know what cats love?
你知道猫咪喜欢什么吗？

958
00:42:34.700 --> 00:42:35.260
Screaming.
尖叫。

959
00:42:35.560 --> 00:42:36.260
And swinging.
还有荡秋千。

960
00:42:36.620 --> 00:42:36.760
Yeah.
是啊。

961
00:42:37.180 --> 00:42:39.140
This cat probably weighed 20 pounds.
这只猫大概有20磅重。

962
00:42:39.140 --> 00:42:40.920
I'm not exaggerating at all.
我一点也没有夸张。

963
00:42:41.020 --> 00:42:41.640
It was enormous.
它太庞大了。

964
00:42:42.180 --> 00:42:48.160
Just the swinging and getting it to my stopping point, it was like, I was like, oh God.
光是荡秋千并把它弄到我停下的位置，我就觉得，当时我就想，天哪。

965
00:42:48.860 --> 00:42:51.660
And then I stop and I hold it in the air.
然后我停下来，把它举在空中。

966
