Freeze.
定格。

967
00:42:52.460 --> 00:42:52.640
Freeze.
定格。

968
00:42:53.100 --> 00:42:56.240
Then they yell cut and in comes my stunt woman in the same outfit.
然后他们喊停，穿着同样衣服的我的替身演员上场了。

969
00:42:56.420 --> 00:42:57.140
She takes real cat.
她拿走真猫。

970
00:42:57.340 --> 00:42:58.300
She holds it in the air.
她把它举在空中。

971
00:42:58.460 --> 00:43:03.780
I step away because what she's going to do with the cat, Jenna, is kind of do the second
我走开，因为她要对猫做的事情，珍娜，有点像是做第二个

972
