Okay.
好吧。

974
00:43:08.060 --> 00:43:11.280
But she kind of gives it a little air, but not a lot of air.
但她有点给它一点空中高度，但不是很高。

975
00:43:11.280 --> 00:43:15.100
And this was like, they don't want you to get all scratched up.
这就好像是，他们不想让你浑身是抓伤。

976
00:43:15.200 --> 00:43:17.420
She knows how to give like a little thing.
她知道怎么做出那种小动作。

977
00:43:17.420 --> 00:43:17.700
Yeah.
是啊。

978
00:43:17.900 --> 00:43:19.980
They had to give the idea of the motion.
他们必须传达出那个动作的概念。

979
00:43:20.140 --> 00:43:20.320
Yeah.
是啊。

980
00:43:20.500 --> 00:43:20.780
Right?
对吧？

981
00:43:21.000 --> 00:43:21.260
Right.
对的。

982
00:43:21.360 --> 00:43:22.440
More than my swing.
比我的晃动幅度还要大。

983
00:43:22.680 --> 00:43:23.080
Got it.
明白了。

984
00:43:23.180 --> 00:43:23.400
Okay.
好的。

985
00:43:23.600 --> 00:43:28.020
And then of course we had to get a take where I had to take Fakie Cat and do the same motion
然后当然，我们得拍一个镜头，我必须拿着假猫，做出和

