Right?
对吧？

989
00:43:33.020 --> 00:43:33.340
Yes.
是的。

990
00:43:33.340 --> 00:43:35.040
They pieced all of that together.
他们把所有这些拼凑在了一起。

991
00:43:36.000 --> 00:43:41.160
So Jenna, I had talked to Jeff Blitz about this moment a while back because I distinctly
所以珍娜，我前段时间跟杰夫·布利茨聊过这个时刻，因为我清楚地

