00:43:41.160 --> 00:43:45.180
remember when we filmed it, two cats coming out of the ceiling instead of one.
记得我们拍摄的时候，天花板里掉出了两只猫，而不是一只。

993
00:43:45.380 --> 00:43:45.740
How?
怎么会？

994
00:43:45.800 --> 00:43:47.100
How, how, how did two cats come out?
怎么会，怎么会，怎么会掉出两只猫？

995
00:43:47.100 --> 00:43:48.800
I don't, that's my memory.
我不知道，那是我的记忆。

996
00:43:48.800 --> 00:43:50.280
And I was like, wait, am I crazy?
当时我想，等等，我是疯了吗？

997
00:43:50.440 --> 00:43:52.280
And I talked to Dean Holland who edited it.
然后我跟负责剪辑的迪恩·霍兰德聊了聊。

998
00:43:52.320 --> 00:43:55.240
And I was like, Dean, did you have to CGI out one cat?
我说，迪恩，你是不是得用CGI去掉一只猫？

999
00:43:55.340 --> 00:43:56.840
Because I know two cats came down.
因为我知道下来了两只猫。

1000
00:43:56.980 --> 00:43:58.340
I remember seeing two cats.
我记得我看到了两只猫。

1001
00:43:58.680 --> 00:43:59.640
He was like, no.
他当时就说，不行。

1002
00:43:59.820 --> 00:44:03.260
And so I talked to Jeff Blitz and he goes, yes, Angela, two cats came down.
然后我跟杰夫·布利茨聊了聊，他说，行啊，安吉拉，两只猫掉下来了。

1003
00:44:03.340 --> 00:44:04.380
And I was like, what?
我说，什么？

1004
00:44:04.560 --> 00:44:10.700
He said, on the take we used, the trainer that was supposed to catch the Fakie Cat missed.
他说，在我们采用的那条镜头里，本该接住假猫的驯兽师没接住。

1005
00:44:11.000 --> 00:44:11.540
Oh.
哦。

1006
00:44:11.920 --> 00:44:17.440
And so then on action, Fakie Cat came out the other side and real cat.
然后一喊开始，假猫从另一边出来了，还有真猫。

1007
00:44:18.320 --> 00:44:20.020
Oh my gosh.
我的天哪。

1008
00:44:20.220 --> 00:44:21.680
Two cats hit the desk.
两只猫掉到了桌上。

1009
00:44:22.020 --> 00:44:27.200
