动用了那么多人和各种调度，但总算剪进正片里了。

1020
00:44:50.880 --> 00:44:52.240
Angela, that is amazing.
安吉拉，这太厉害了。

1021
00:44:52.740 --> 00:44:55.220
I did not know all the details of that story.
我之前都不知道这个故事的全部细节。

1022
00:44:56.060 --> 00:44:57.600
I was on the edge of my seat.
我听得心都提到了嗓子眼。

1023
00:44:57.600 --> 00:44:58.720
I absolutely loved that.
我太喜欢这个了。

1024
00:44:59.480 --> 00:45:04.340
You guys, the crazy thing is it took me that long to tell that story, but it happened in five seconds.
伙计们，疯狂的是，我讲这个故事花了这么长时间，但它只发生了五秒钟。

1025
00:45:04.340 --> 00:45:04.960
Oh my God.
我的天哪。

1026
00:45:04.980 --> 00:45:07.500
When we actually filmed it, it was so quick.
我们实际拍摄的时候，速度非常快。

1027
00:45:07.880 --> 00:45:12.880
So it was like me, drawer, cat, swing, step out, step mom, Fakie Cat.
所以过程大概是：我、抽屉、猫、挥手、迈出一步、继母、假猫。

1028
00:45:13.140 --> 00:45:14.940
Oh my God, two cats, react to one.
天呐，两只猫，但只对其中一只做出反应。

1029
00:45:18.180 --> 00:45:24.580
Well, you mentioned that there was something else going on during all this, which was Oscar going in and out of the ceiling.
对了，你提到当时还有别的事在发生，就是奥斯卡进出天花板。

1030
00:45:24.860 --> 00:45:27.320
Yes, that was a whole other ordeal.
对，那又是另一场折腾。

1031
00:45:27.920 --> 00:45:41.620
Randy told us that that part of the stunt of getting Oscar up into the ceiling was the other most challenging part of the stunt because there was nothing to climb into in the way that our set was built.
兰迪告诉我们，把奥斯卡弄进天花板这部分特技是另一个最具挑战性的部分，因为按照我们布景的搭建方式，根本没地方可爬。

1032
00:45:41.620 --> 00:45:48.220
Like the actual lightweight drop ceiling, it was suspended from cables.
就像那个真正的轻质吊顶，它是用缆绳悬挂着的。

1033
00:45:48.660 --> 00:45:51.080
Yeah, very thin rigging wires.
对，非常细的索具钢丝。

1034
00:45:51.220 --> 00:45:57.340
It was Fakie ceiling, guys, because our set was inside a humongous soundstage.
那是假天花板，伙计们，因为我们的布景是在一个巨大的摄影棚里。

1035
00:45:57.560 --> 00:45:57.780
Yeah.
对。

1036
00:45:58.040 --> 00:46:01.420
So actually above the Dunder Mifflin offices was just air.
所以邓德米夫林办公室的上方其实只是空气。

1037
00:46:01.640 --> 00:46:06.760
If you walked outside, you could look up and just see these wires holding Fakie ceiling.
如果你走到外面，抬头就能看到那些吊着假天花板的电线。

1038
00:46:07.060 --> 00:46:07.280
Yeah.
对。

1039
00:46:07.280 --> 00:46:19.840
So he said in the weeks prior to filming this, our production designer, Michael Gallenberg, and construction coordinator, Tim James, had to completely re-engineer the ceiling.
所以他说，在拍摄前的几周里，我们的美术指导迈克尔·盖伦伯格和施工统筹蒂姆·詹姆斯不得不完全重新设计天花板。

1040
00:46:20.240 --> 00:46:23.660
They had to like build rafters basically that we didn't have, right?
他们基本上得搭建我们原本没有的椽子，对吧？

1041
00:46:23.920 --> 00:46:24.260
Yeah.
对。

1042
00:46:24.460 --> 00:46:29.940
And it had to be enough to support not just Oscar, but all of the stunt personnel.
而且必须能够支撑的不仅是奥斯卡，还有所有的特技人员。

1043
00:46:29.940 --> 00:46:42.820
